      ],
      "source": "https://northernmichiganhistory.com/st-ignace-michigans-timeless-gateway-to-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Fort de Buade, a fur‑trade post founded by Louis de La Porte in 1681, still stands as a reconstructed museum in Saint Ignace.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
